San José MadeSJMADE Holiday Fair returns to the Santa Clara Convention Center for Black Friday and Small Business Saturday with more than 350 makers, artists, designers, illustrators, artisans, bakers, crafters, and creative small businesses. The free indoor holiday shopping fair includes free parking, an event-exclusive grocery bag giveaway for the first 1,000 attendees each day, and an Event Ski Stamp Station at Info Booth A.
Original Event Description:
_View the 2nd preview of this year’s SJMADE Holiday Fair 2026, the Bay Area’s largest holiday craft fair. Happening on Nov. 27 (Black Friday) and Nov. 28 (Small Business Saturday). Featuring over 350+ of some of the very, very, very best makers, artists, designers, illustrators, artisans, bakers, crafters and creative small businesses all in one fun, festive holiday shopping experience!
